  <name>Kast Manager</name>
  <summary>Processes, resources, disks and files in one dark place</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Kast Manager is a fresh, minimal system companion with a dark neon
      interface. It shows live system stats, processes, resource graphs,
      file systems and a small file browser — written from scratch,
      no GNOME System Monitor code inside.
    </p>
  </description>
  <update_contact>khannatejas989_at_gmail.com</update_contact>
